  <metadata>
    <desc>Extract from a real Apple Health export, relocated to a neutral origin and re-based to a fixed start time. Kept for the GPS artefact it contains; the surrounding geometry is genuine recorded movement. The closing stretch is unaltered; the final point alone was displaced 2.2 km to stage a terminal spike, a case the recorded routes happen not to contain. Serialized with lat before lon, the order Garmin and gpx.studio emit, so the loader is exercised against both attribute orders.</desc>
  </metadata>
